"By default during the validation of an invoice, an asset is created by "
"invoice line as long as an accounting entry is created by invoice line. With"
" this setting, an accounting entry will be created by product item. So, "
"there will be an asset by product item."
msgstr ""
"Fakturak baliozkotzean aktibo bat sortuko da lehenespenez faktura-lerro "
"bakoitzeko, baldin eta kontabilitate-idazpen bat sortzen bada faktura-lerro "
"bakoitzeko. Ezarpen horren bidez, kontabilitate-idazpen bat sortuko da "
"produktuaren elementu bakoitzeko. Beraz, aktibo bat egongo da produktuaren "
"elementu bakoitzeko."

